OL,3,GNEWSAGet set, ready, go! Great North
OL,4,ARun weekend begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FSunday's 13.1-mile (21km) event sees
OL,7,Frunners and wheelchair users begin in
OL,8,FNewcastle, race through Gateshead and
OL,9,FSouth Tyneside before finishing in
OL,10,FSouth Shields.
